@startuml lld-us14-sequence
title LLD-US14 Send money by IMPS: sequence diagram
skinparam monochrome true
autonumber
participant Browser
participant TransferService
participant LimitService
participant ImpsClient
Browser -> TransferService : POST /transfers/imps
TransferService -> LimitService : check(20000)
Browser -> TransferService : confirm(OTP)
TransferService -> ImpsClient : send()
ImpsClient --> TransferService : ref, SUCCESS
TransferService --> Browser : Success
@enduml